{"id":"n69523-5-5","stage":0,"title":"울다 · 耳鸣","scene":"健康与身体","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69523-5-5-1","ko":"환자분, 어디가 안 좋으세요?","zh":"请问您哪里不舒服？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"환자분,","meaning":"患者（敬称）","explanation":"환자：患者；-분 是对人的敬称。","readings":[{"term":"환자","audio":"/audio/7780fb9b6e0ea5fdf5fa.mp3"},{"term":"분","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31669","senseId":"1","lemma":"환자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"27780","senseId":"1","lemma":"분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"환자분","audio":"/audio/b67c1dee24532e77b60d.mp3"}},{"text":"어디가","meaning":"哪里","explanation":"어디：哪里；-가 标记不舒服的部位。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디가","audio":"/audio/6d28cfb014a6b7e4f086.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"좋으세요?","meaning":"不舒服吗","explanation":"좋다：好；안 좋다 指身体不舒服，-으세요? 是尊敬式礼貌问句。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"4","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋으세요","audio":"/audio/8e737bc147cd7797829a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7780fb9b6e0ea5fd","term":"환자","zh":"患者，病人","audio":"/audio/7780fb9b6e0ea5fdf5fa.mp3","entryId":"31669","definition":"由于身体生病或受伤而疼痛的人。","pronunciation":["환ː자"]},{"id":"ca4a187881dbf529","term":"분","zh":"位","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3","entryId":"27780","definition":"对人的尊称。","pronunciation":["분"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"舒服、好","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"表示身体健康或状态好；안 좋다 在这里指身体不舒服。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/703b5bb28b719193616a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69523-5-5-2","ko":"귀에서 자꾸 우는 소리가 들려서 잠을 못 자요.","zh":"耳朵里一直有嗡嗡声，所以睡不着觉。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"귀에서","meaning":"从耳朵里","explanation":"귀：耳朵；-에서 表示声音出现的地方。","readings":[{"term":"귀","audio":"/audio/001e793a4472c6fe6269.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60201","senseId":"1","lemma":"귀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"귀에서","audio":"/audio/3730aea82ab48289184e.mp3"}},{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"자꾸：一直，总是。","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}},{"text":"우는","meaning":"耳鸣的","explanation":"울다：耳鸣；-는 修饰后面的 소리。","readings":[{"term":"울다","audio":"/audio/7136d2464083681e4841.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69523","senseId":"5","lemma":"울다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우는","audio":"/audio/6d91c6c909e425c774df.mp3"}},{"text":"소리가","meaning":"声音，声，音，动静","explanation":"소리：声音，声，音，动静；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"소리","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62379","senseId":"1","lemma":"소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소리가","audio":"/audio/0c12216fc63402c5db52.mp3"}},{"text":"들려서","meaning":"总能听见，所以","explanation":"들리다：听见；-어서 说明无法入睡的原因。","readings":[{"term":"들리다","audio":"/audio/f5d8f68f409d3cd71df1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70783","senseId":"1","lemma":"들리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들려서","audio":"/audio/752df2d7df8cf3289a20.mp3"}},{"text":"잠을","meaning":"觉，睡眠","explanation":"잠：觉，睡眠；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"잠","audio":"/audio/699e97260979403d2584.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70078","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잠을","audio":"/audio/76afcb272f116ce8b9ef.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","explanation":"못：不能、没能（能力或条件限制）。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"자요.","meaning":"睡，睡觉","explanation":"자다：睡，睡觉；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"자다","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69511","senseId":"1","lemma":"자다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자요","audio":"/audio/06bda50561159508e850.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"001e793a4472c6fe","term":"귀","zh":"耳，耳朵","audio":"/audio/001e793a4472c6fe6269.mp3","entryId":"60201","definition":"长在人或动物头部两侧，可以听到声音的身体的一部分。","pronunciation":["귀"]},{"id":"d28ff63a0382ce4f","term":"자꾸","zh":"一直，总是","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3","entryId":"70796","definition":"多次连续地。","pronunciation":["자꾸"]},{"id":"7136d2464083681e","term":"울다","zh":"耳鸣","audio":"/audio/7136d2464083681e4841.mp3","entryId":"69523","definition":"感觉耳内有实际不存在的声响；这里指反复耳鸣。","pronunciation":["울ː다"]},{"id":"d13cec79f66edb6a","term":"소리","zh":"声音，声，音，动静","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3","entryId":"62379","definition":"物体震动发出的音波传入耳朵中产生的响声。","pronunciation":["소리"]},{"id":"f5d8f68f409d3cd7","term":"들리다","zh":"听到，传来","audio":"/audio/f5d8f68f409d3cd71df1.mp3","entryId":"70783","definition":"通过耳朵接受声音。","pronunciation":["들리다"]},{"id":"699e97260979403d","term":"잠","zh":"觉，睡眠","audio":"/audio/699e97260979403d2584.mp3","entryId":"70078","definition":"指闭上眼睛，停止身体、精神活动而休息一会儿的状态。","pronunciation":["잠"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不能、没法","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"因能力或条件限制而不能做；这里是因为耳鸣睡不着。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"023aa5fb34178979","term":"자다","zh":"睡，睡觉","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3","entryId":"69511","definition":"闭眼睛，停止身体、精神活动，一时进入休息状态。","pronunciation":["자다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7da63b22dcca5c87bdba.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.04,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=69523","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"5","sourceLevel":"초급","day":29,"sequenceScore":1.2672,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["耳朵里一直有嗡嗡声，所以睡不着觉。","爸爸，这次假期我们要去哪儿呢？","请问您哪里不舒服？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["耳朵里一直有嗡嗡声，所以睡不着觉。","请问您哪里不舒服？","爸爸，这次假期我们要去哪儿呢？"],"answer":0}]}
